se> . ” He <4 went on> to <37 say> , “ the Chargers have always been leaders and positive contributors to our community . We <26 take> our <40 stature> in the community very <42 seriously> . Through the Chargers and the NFL , our players <27 receive> one of the most comprehensive education and support programs in <28 sports> to help them <29 deal with> issues that <30 affect> all segments of society . ” Vincent Jackson , the Chargers receiver , was also recently <31 arrested> on <32 allegations> of <33 DUI> . His <34 DUI arrest> occurred five days before San Diego ’ s playoff <35 loss> at Pittsburgh . Jackson ’ s court date is set for February 17 , 2009 . When he was <5 arrested> , he was <43 on probation> for a <6 previous DUI arrest> , <39 according to> the California Highway Patrol .", "gold": [["9", "causes", "8"], ["8", "causes", "22"], ["16", "causes", "17"], ["8", "causes", "16"], ["11", "causes", "10"], ["33", "causes", "31"], ["13", "causes", "12"], ["10", "causes", "16"], ["18", "causes", "17"], ["6", "causes", "43"], ["10", "causes", "22"], ["8", "causedby", "9"], ["22", "causedby", "8"], ["17", "causedby", "16"], ["16", "causedby", "8"], ["10", "causedby", "11"], ["31", "causedby", "33"], ["12", "causedby", "13"], ["16", "causedby", "10"], ["17", "causedby", "18"], ["43", "causedby", "6"], ["22", "causedby", "10"]], "lang": "eng", "mentions": ["7", "24", "22", "8", "44", "9", "10", "11", "12", "13", "14", "15", "3", "16", "17", "18", "38", "86", "36", "1", "19", "41", "2", "20", "21", "25", "23", "4", "37", "26", "40", "42", "27", "28", "29", "30", "31", "32", "33", "34", "35", "5", "43", "6", "39"], "surfaces": {"7": "Faces", "24": "DUI", "22": "Charges", "8": "arrested", "44": "on suspicion", "9": "drunk driving", "10": "arrested", "11": "DUI", "12": "pulled over", "13": "speeding", "14": "submitted", "15": "take", "3": "completed", "16": "taken", "17": "released", "18": "on bail", "38": "According to", "86": "submitted", "36": "said", "1": "continue",